W4-15 POST HOC power check (no verdict weight): frozen planting recipe on an uncorrelated (shuffled) baseline
  median achieved rho +0.299; detected at p < 0.05 in 76% and at p < 0.0027 in 35% of 200 realisations
  (the recipe's 0.3 std(s)/std(x) is not rho = 0.3 for heavy-tailed slopes; the achieved rho is the operative power point)
